Hi all,

In server.R,
output$id<-renderText({input$xx})

If I want to do the following in ui.R
tags$script(src = output$id)

what should I do?

I tried the following and didn't work.

 HTML(paste("<script src='", "<span id='id' class='shiny-text-output'></span>", "'></script>", sep=""))

Thanks.

From uca443e6eaa0e78ed at groups.google.com  Sat Dec 29 23:40:00 2018
From: uca443e6eaa0e78ed at groups.google.com (Joe Cheng)
Date: Sat, 29 Dec 2018 23:40:00 +0000
Subject: Re: HTML script tag for server output
Message-ID: <KqYdZ4ptqI0.uEg2B1JfCgAJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <KqYdZ4ptqI0.bzqKSB8FDAAJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
References: <KqYdZ4ptqI0.bzqKSB8FDAAJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
