MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

You can't ever "read" output$id--it's not a place to store values. Instead, create a uiOutput/renderUI whose render expression is tags$script(src = input$xx).

